{"id":"84a32d5c69ef656e","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-solovay-preorder.md","title":"Solovay Reducibility Is a Preorder","display":"thm-solovay-preorder — Solovay Reducibility Is a Preorder","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-solovay-preorder","aliases":["43-thm-solovay-preorder"],"display":"thm-solovay-preorder — Solovay Reducibility Is a Preorder","depends_on":["[[43-df-solovay-red]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"§13.2, Solovay reducibility","source_printed_pages":"340–342","source_pdf_pages":"360–362","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-solovay-preorder"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-solovay-preorder</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-solovay-preorder — Solovay Reducibility Is a Preorder"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a566c9610179ba40\" href=\"?note=a566c9610179ba40\" title=\"43-df-solovay-red\">43-df-solovay-red</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§13.2, Solovay reducibility"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"340–342"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"360–362"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span> 均满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LeftComputable}\">\\(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_S\">\\(\\le_S\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a566c9610179ba40\" href=\"?note=a566c9610179ba40\" title=\"43-df-solovay-red\">43-df-solovay-red</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\le_S\\alpha\\land\\left(\\alpha\\le_S\\beta\\land\\beta\\le_S\\gamma\\to\\alpha\\le_S\\gamma\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\alpha\\le_S\\alpha\\land\\left(\\alpha\\le_S\\beta\\land\\beta\\le_S\\gamma\\to\\alpha\\le_S\\gamma\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>自反性取同一近似。传递性可由等价的部分有理映射版本复合并乘误差常数，或同步重索引有效近似。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，§13.2, Solovay reducibility；印刷页 340–342，PDF 页 360–362。本次逐项核对陈述；来源证明的已读范围见本次审阅账本，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-solovay-red","status":"resolved","id":"a566c9610179ba40","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-solovay-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-solovay-red","status":"resolved","id":"a566c9610179ba40","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\in\\mathbb R$ 均满足 $\\mathrm{LeftComputable}$；$\\le_S$ 见 [[43-df-solovay-red]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\in\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LeftComputable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\le_S\\alpha\\land\\left(\\alpha\\le_S\\beta\\land\\beta\\le_S\\gamma\\to\\alpha\\le_S\\gamma\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1293,"backlinks":[{"id":"a4894b7383014259","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathbb R$；$\\mathrm{LeftComputable}$ 与 $\\le_S$ 采用 [[43-df-solovay-red]]。本节引入集合 $\\mathcal L$、二元关系 $\\equiv_S,<_S$、商集 $\\mathcal L/{\\equiv_S}$ 及其序关系 $\\preccurlyeq_S$；$\\le_S$ 的自反性与传递性见 [[43-thm-solovay-preorder]]。"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-317","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-solovay-preorder]] — Solovay Reducibility Is a Preorder"}],"outgoing":["a566c9610179ba40"]}